# Deploy target

After a finished studio change, publish it. Use one of these two places:

- Production: `npx vercel --prod --yes --scope history7` from the repo. The live site is https://app.codeandbuild.tech.
- Local: `npm run dev`, which serves http://localhost:3000.

Do not leave the app only on port 3001. Do not start a second dev server if port 3000 is already running. Do not commit or git push unless the user asks.
